er, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":212555,"global_rank":260290},{"name":"andrewnachtigal/Algorithms","owner":"andrewnachtigal","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewnachtigal/Algorithms","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python implementation of algorithms. Self study materials to accompany MIT OCW 6.006","topics":[],"score":212553,"global_rank":260296},{"name":"jnawjux/cleangeo","owner":"jnawjux","html_url":"https://github.com/jnawjux/cleangeo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212552,"global_rank":260309},{"name":"madhuroopa/Distributed-Systems","owner":"madhuroopa","html_url":"https://github.com/madhuroopa/Distributed-Systems","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212552,"global_rank":260310},{"name":"philion/ticket-threader","owner":"philion","html_url":"https://github.com/philion/ticket-threader","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"An external message threader for redmine","topics":[],"score":212552,"global_rank":260317},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":212549,"global_rank":260323},{"name":"yeyfreya/tic-tac-toe-turbo","owner":"yeyfreya","html_url":"https://github.com/yeyfreya/tic-tac-toe-turbo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212543,"global_rank":260333},{"name":"aydenarmst/Airline-Search-Engine","owner":"aydenarmst","html_url":"https://github.com/aydenarmst/Airline-Search-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","descript